WEBVTT

00:00:02.980 --> 00:00:04.230
What?

00:00:04.230 --> 00:00:07.900
You and Shion-san were scouted for the Prodigy Team?

00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:08.910
Yeah.

00:00:08.910 --> 00:00:11.000
By Shikyouin Hibiki?

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:11.930
Yeah.

00:00:11.930 --> 00:00:13.400
What are you going to do?

00:00:14.350 --> 00:00:16.030
I don't want to join,

00:00:16.510 --> 00:00:19.040
but I'm still thinking about it.

00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:22.140
If it's something you want to do,

00:00:22.140 --> 00:00:24.380
you don't have to hold yourself back because of us.

00:00:24.380 --> 00:00:25.290
Huh?!

00:00:25.290 --> 00:00:28.250
Besides, it's really up to the charms.

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:29.290
Eh?

00:00:29.930 --> 00:00:31.970
Oh, yeah...

00:00:33.470 --> 00:00:34.400
Aha!

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:37.100
Tokuda Nene is wherever there's a big story!

00:00:37.100 --> 00:00:41.310
Toudou Shion and Houjou Sophie have been scouted for the Prodigy Team!

00:00:41.310 --> 00:00:44.020
This is quite the scoop!

00:02:15.740 --> 00:02:17.910
Go'ing My Way

00:02:21.950 --> 00:02:23.110
Huh?

00:02:23.110 --> 00:02:25.410
Shion-san isn't with you today?

00:02:25.410 --> 00:02:27.360
No idea why.

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:35.840
She's been meditating in front of her Go board all day.

00:02:35.840 --> 00:02:38.440
She seems so distant for some reason.

00:02:38.440 --> 00:02:42.890
Good grief, would it kill Shion to talk to us if she's worried about something?

00:02:43.750 --> 00:02:44.880
She didn't tell you?

00:02:44.880 --> 00:02:45.530
Huh?

00:02:45.530 --> 00:02:46.810
Tell us what?

00:02:46.810 --> 00:02:49.230
Shikyouin-san asked her...

00:02:49.230 --> 00:02:51.690
There you are, Houjou Sophie-san!

00:02:51.690 --> 00:02:53.360
So you've come!

00:02:53.360 --> 00:02:56.530
Could we get your current thoughts on being scouted for the Prodigy Team?

00:02:57.810 --> 00:02:59.360
How does it feel?

00:02:59.360 --> 00:03:04.080
There's no way you could turn down Hibiki-san's invitation now that she's more popular than ever, is there?

00:03:04.080 --> 00:03:05.610
What do you have to say?!

00:03:05.610 --> 00:03:06.540
Ah, um...

00:03:06.540 --> 00:03:07.240
Oh!

00:03:07.240 --> 00:03:10.620
Why if it isn't Dorothy-san and Leona-san of Dressing Pafé.

00:03:10.620 --> 00:03:13.310
Could you give us a word about Shion-san joining that same Prodigy Team?

00:03:13.310 --> 00:03:15.840
Oh man...

00:03:15.840 --> 00:03:17.420
Eh?!

00:03:17.420 --> 00:03:18.560
What are your current feelings?

00:03:18.560 --> 00:03:20.670
What's going to happen to your team?

00:03:20.670 --> 00:03:22.310
Is there anything about Shikyouin-san that's peaked your interest?

00:03:22.310 --> 00:03:23.470
Shion...

00:03:23.470 --> 00:03:26.260
...was scouted for Hibiki-san's team?!

00:03:26.260 --> 00:03:28.060
So that's what she's stressing over...

00:03:28.060 --> 00:03:30.570
Dorothy-san! Leona-san!

00:03:31.520 --> 00:03:33.620
Time to help Sophie-sama out!

00:03:33.620 --> 00:03:35.320
We'll leave the rest to you!

00:03:35.320 --> 00:03:36.460
Now get going!

00:03:36.460 --> 00:03:37.740
Capisce!

00:03:42.290 --> 00:03:44.190
I think you're safe here, Sophie-san.

00:03:44.190 --> 00:03:45.320
Pushuu~

00:03:45.320 --> 00:03:46.780
Ah, it's Sophie-san!

00:03:46.780 --> 00:03:49.420
You're going to join Shikyouin-san's team, aren't you?!

00:03:49.420 --> 00:03:51.010
What are the rest of you going to do?

00:03:51.010 --> 00:03:52.710
Oh cut it out! Shut up!

00:03:57.850 --> 00:03:58.440
Eh?!

00:03:58.440 --> 00:04:00.660
You're safe now.

00:04:00.660 --> 00:04:01.840
Fuwari-chan?!

00:04:02.480 --> 00:04:03.460
Huh?!

00:04:13.140 --> 00:04:14.940
You're returning to the Palps?

00:04:15.300 --> 00:04:19.370
All sorts of things have happened, and now I'm kind of worn out...

00:04:19.370 --> 00:04:21.150
Even Ookanda-sensei suggested it...

00:04:21.150 --> 00:04:24.490
That I should take a short vacation.

00:04:24.490 --> 00:04:27.690
You're welcome back whenever you feel better.

00:04:27.690 --> 00:04:31.450
Rina-chan and the rest of us will be waiting.

00:04:31.450 --> 00:04:34.190
It's Toriko's fault, isn't it?!

00:04:34.190 --> 00:04:35.530
Not at all.

00:04:35.530 --> 00:04:38.030
It would be better if Toriko wasn't here-tori!

00:04:38.030 --> 00:04:39.110
Stop that.

00:04:39.110 --> 00:04:40.840
If Toriko wasn't here,

00:04:40.840 --> 00:04:43.610
who would be my manager?

00:04:43.610 --> 00:04:46.890
Fuwari... Toriko loves you-tori!

00:04:47.470 --> 00:04:48.790
Don't worry.

00:04:48.790 --> 00:04:52.840
I'll take in the fresh Palps air and be better in no time.

00:04:55.640 --> 00:04:58.790
Promise us you'll come back!

00:05:05.280 --> 00:05:06.590
Take care!

00:05:06.590 --> 00:05:08.150
I'll make sure to write.

00:05:09.370 --> 00:05:12.280
And do your best to put on lively concerts!

00:05:12.280 --> 00:05:13.350
Promise!

00:05:13.350 --> 00:05:15.750
Promise you'll come back!

00:05:15.750 --> 00:05:20.120
If you don't come back, I'll take the rest of the coords for myself!

00:05:20.120 --> 00:05:21.840
Dorothy's serious about that!

00:05:22.190 --> 00:05:24.070
Take care!

00:05:31.570 --> 00:05:32.900
Fuwari-chan...

00:05:32.900 --> 00:05:37.850
I wonder if Midorikaze-san enjoyed living here in Parajuku?

00:05:37.850 --> 00:05:39.140
Huh?

00:05:40.690 --> 00:05:44.000
That's the nail in the coffin. Shikyouin is definitely evil!

00:05:44.000 --> 00:05:45.820
It's a fact!

00:05:45.820 --> 00:05:48.740
I'm going to kick her butt next time!

00:05:53.950 --> 00:05:56.820
Someone must be talking about you, Hibiki-sama.

00:05:57.750 --> 00:05:59.490
No, I'm fine.

00:06:00.420 --> 00:06:03.060
Fuwari-sama seems to have gone somewhere.

00:06:03.060 --> 00:06:03.840
Huh?

00:06:03.840 --> 00:06:05.300
Where'd she go?

00:06:05.580 --> 00:06:08.190
Back to her home in the Palps.

00:06:08.500 --> 00:06:11.520
It seems she plans on returning in the future.

00:06:11.830 --> 00:06:13.090
Oh?

00:06:14.160 --> 00:06:15.610
More importantly,

00:06:15.610 --> 00:06:19.900
my Prodigy Team is the hot topic on campus.

00:06:20.480 --> 00:06:24.410
Shall I go ask Shion-sama and Sophie-sama for their response?

00:06:25.480 --> 00:06:28.320
They'll eventually jump on it even if I leave them alone.

00:06:29.040 --> 00:06:31.870
Prodigies are drawn to each other.

00:06:32.300 --> 00:06:36.290
Besides, they will eventually grow unsatisfied with being amongst those of average skill.

00:06:43.620 --> 00:06:46.880
She's been like that ever since she came to PriPara-usa.

00:06:48.840 --> 00:06:50.760
<i>Airy Change!</i>

00:06:54.030 --> 00:06:56.220
<i>Golden Airy!</i>

00:06:57.340 --> 00:07:03.970
<i>I was fascinated by those wings despite never thinking that I'd find anything other than black and white beautiful...</i>

00:07:03.970 --> 00:07:06.860
What might you be so conflicted over?

00:07:06.860 --> 00:07:08.260
Iroha?!

00:07:08.260 --> 00:07:10.800
I've heard this rumour;

00:07:10.800 --> 00:07:16.990
that someone I'm proud to call my rival has been selected to be a princess candidate.

00:07:17.500 --> 00:07:20.720
I've yet to decide if I'll do it or not.

00:07:20.720 --> 00:07:23.880
Then are you saying you're quitting?

00:07:23.880 --> 00:07:27.270
If you don't push forward, strive to new heights,

00:07:27.270 --> 00:07:29.470
you'll never be able to become a Divine Idol.

00:07:29.470 --> 00:07:33.220
Or perhaps have you given up on being a Divine Idol?

00:07:33.220 --> 00:07:33.970
I haven't!

00:07:33.970 --> 00:07:35.920
I'm not giving up!

00:07:35.920 --> 00:07:39.390
I'm not straying from my original dream!

00:07:39.390 --> 00:07:42.440
Just what I'd expect from my rival.

00:07:42.680 --> 00:07:44.850
However, please remember this.

00:07:44.850 --> 00:07:48.190
I'll be catching up to you soon enough.

00:07:50.920 --> 00:07:52.180
Iroha...

00:07:52.860 --> 00:07:57.440
<i>As we're prodigies, a reaction that no one has seen before will take place as we sing together.</i>

00:07:57.440 --> 00:08:01.750
<i>And then we'll be able to see a scene no one has seen before.</i>

00:08:01.750 --> 00:08:04.260
I'll see it! I want to see it!

00:08:04.260 --> 00:08:06.150
That new scenery!

00:08:06.150 --> 00:08:09.210
I also want to perform a Golden Airy!

00:08:09.790 --> 00:08:11.020
Shion...

00:08:11.920 --> 00:08:13.270
Pushuu~

00:08:13.270 --> 00:08:15.640
We'll definitely win this concert!

00:08:15.640 --> 00:08:18.720
Kuma-san, put us through the wringer!

00:08:18.720 --> 00:08:20.630
I saw this coming-kuma!

00:08:20.630 --> 00:08:22.600
It's time for me to get serious-kuma!

00:08:23.460 --> 00:08:25.440
Watch this and let's dance-kuma!

00:08:25.880 --> 00:08:26.650
Right!

00:08:26.650 --> 00:08:28.310
1, 2, 3, 4.

00:08:28.310 --> 00:08:28.530
Now spin four times!

00:08:28.530 --> 00:08:30.560
2, 2, 3, 4.

00:08:30.560 --> 00:08:31.650
3, 2, 3, 4.

00:08:31.650 --> 00:08:32.570
Lala, you're late-kuma!

00:08:32.570 --> 00:08:33.870
4, 2, 3, 4.

00:08:33.870 --> 00:08:34.840
You have to chain your movements together properly-kuma!

00:08:34.840 --> 00:08:36.750
1, 2, 3, 4.

00:08:36.750 --> 00:08:36.780
2, 2, 3, 4.

00:08:36.780 --> 00:08:38.780
And after that you lift your head and jump!

00:08:38.780 --> 00:08:40.620
C-Capisce!

00:08:42.030 --> 00:08:44.920
Mirei, that wasn't high enough-kuma!

00:08:44.920 --> 00:08:45.540
Pri!

00:08:46.290 --> 00:08:49.500
<i>Can someone who doesn't have talent get it if they work hard enough?</i>

00:08:50.060 --> 00:08:51.290
<i>No.</i>

00:08:51.290 --> 00:08:54.220
<i>They'll just further drag down the other prodigies.</i>

00:08:54.220 --> 00:08:58.390
<i>You haven't won a GrandPrix yet, have you, Minami Mirei-kun?</i>

00:09:00.350 --> 00:09:02.170
That's not true-pri!

00:09:02.170 --> 00:09:08.270
Someone said "Genius is 1% talent and 99% percent hard work"-pri!

00:09:08.270 --> 00:09:12.570
In that case, I'll win by putting in 101%-pri!

00:09:12.570 --> 00:09:13.560
That's the spirit-kuma!

00:09:13.560 --> 00:09:15.030
Now jump-kuma!

00:09:15.530 --> 00:09:17.620
1, 2, 3, 4

00:09:18.430 --> 00:09:20.660
Pushuu~

00:09:24.330 --> 00:09:26.420
That was amazing, Sophie-san!

00:09:29.460 --> 00:09:31.670
Pushuu~

00:09:32.530 --> 00:09:34.630
What can you do about it-nekon?

00:09:34.630 --> 00:09:38.330
That 1% wall isn't something easily overcome-nekon.

00:09:38.330 --> 00:09:40.350
I know that-kuma!

00:09:40.710 --> 00:09:46.310
But Mirei has been training harder than anyone ever since she came to PriPara-kuma!

00:09:46.310 --> 00:09:49.010
Despite that, she still can't overcome it...

00:09:49.010 --> 00:09:51.360
This world's not fair-kuma!

00:09:51.360 --> 00:09:54.710
I want to help Mirei win-kuma!

00:09:55.990 --> 00:10:00.730
Those blessed with talent are the ones who receive fame and glory,

00:10:00.730 --> 00:10:04.780
while those who are not end up suffering-neko.

00:10:04.780 --> 00:10:07.410
Toriko is always around when there is suffering-tori.

00:10:07.410 --> 00:10:08.210
Kuma?!
Neko?!

00:10:09.210 --> 00:10:11.170
You surprised me-kuma!

00:10:11.170 --> 00:10:13.040
You can come out and join us...

00:10:13.040 --> 00:10:15.970
He's depressed since Fuwari-chan went home-neko.

00:10:15.970 --> 00:10:20.330
The "to" in Toirko is for "too much trouble", the "ri" is for "risk of downsizing..."

00:10:20.850 --> 00:10:26.790
I've also seen many idols
who were hurt like that leave PriPara.

00:10:26.790 --> 00:10:30.150
There were also cases of idols falling into despair due to their manager's uselessness-neko.

00:10:30.150 --> 00:10:32.760
Has that happened to you as well?!

00:10:33.170 --> 00:10:36.590
Delving into a woman's history is poor manners-neko!

00:10:36.590 --> 00:10:37.990
I'm sorry-kuma!

00:10:37.990 --> 00:10:43.530
Toriko was an unwanted child born one stormy winter night-tori.

00:10:43.530 --> 00:10:45.800
No one asked you-kuma!

00:10:45.800 --> 00:10:49.000
An overnight mistake...

00:10:49.510 --> 00:10:51.590
We can't let it end like this-usa!

00:10:51.590 --> 00:10:53.140
Of course-kuma!

00:10:53.140 --> 00:10:57.050
We'll show Hibiki how much effort Mirei,
the others, and us managers are putting in-kuma!

00:10:57.050 --> 00:11:00.090
Is it going to be a battle between the prodigies and hard workers-nekon?

00:11:00.090 --> 00:11:01.200
That's right-kuma!

00:11:01.200 --> 00:11:04.810
If they're calling themselves the Prodigy Team, then we'll form Team Effort!

00:11:07.440 --> 00:11:08.510
Kuma?

00:11:09.430 --> 00:11:11.080
Oh, Dorothy-usa?

00:11:11.080 --> 00:11:12.770
Good timing-usa!

00:11:12.770 --> 00:11:15.500
I just came up with your catchphrase-usa!

00:11:15.500 --> 00:11:16.360
Like I care!

00:11:16.360 --> 00:11:19.430
More importantly, Shion is... That stupid Shion is...

00:11:19.430 --> 00:11:21.100
Dorothy, relax.

00:11:21.100 --> 00:11:22.700
As if I can relax right now!

00:11:23.030 --> 00:11:24.160
<i>Usa...</i>

00:11:27.370 --> 00:11:29.240
I'll take you up on your offer.

00:11:29.950 --> 00:11:32.080
I will join your team.

00:11:32.690 --> 00:11:35.540
I'm glad to hear that, Toudou Shion.

00:11:35.960 --> 00:11:38.850
Welcome to the Prodigy Team.

00:11:50.430 --> 00:11:52.100
Decisively resolute.

00:11:52.100 --> 00:11:53.150
I have no regrets.

00:11:53.150 --> 00:11:54.990
You're a traitor, Shion!

00:11:54.990 --> 00:11:56.100
A crumb!

00:11:56.100 --> 00:11:58.280
How could you team up with such a vile person?!

00:11:58.280 --> 00:11:58.800
Dorothy, relax.

00:11:58.800 --> 00:12:00.610
How? How could you?!

00:12:01.020 --> 00:12:02.710
Why are you doing it, Shion?

00:12:02.710 --> 00:12:04.570
It doesn't make any sense.

00:12:05.490 --> 00:12:08.890
I'd like to see those wings once more.

00:12:09.680 --> 00:12:10.830
Wings?

00:12:13.170 --> 00:12:18.540
That was the first time I've seen something more beautiful than black or white.

00:12:18.540 --> 00:12:21.810
I'd like to form those wings myself!

00:12:21.810 --> 00:12:23.520
I believe I can do it!

00:12:23.520 --> 00:12:25.300
It doesn't matter if I win or lose.

00:12:25.640 --> 00:12:27.080
That's it!

00:12:27.080 --> 00:12:28.390
That's all there is to it!

00:12:28.390 --> 00:12:31.170
That's why you joined Hibiki's team?

00:12:31.170 --> 00:12:34.030
I don't want to regret my time here in PriPara!

00:12:40.900 --> 00:12:42.570
Shion's going to her side.

00:12:42.570 --> 00:12:43.860
What's happening?

00:12:44.430 --> 00:12:46.830
Shion has made up her mind-usa.

00:12:46.830 --> 00:12:50.580
I had a feeling it would somehow end up like this-usa.

00:12:50.580 --> 00:12:51.890
Huh?

00:12:51.890 --> 00:12:53.150
Shion,

00:12:53.150 --> 00:12:57.790
it's my job as your manager to help your abilities take flight-usa.

00:12:58.130 --> 00:13:04.550
And I've seen idols sparkle when they've been set free-usa.

00:13:06.460 --> 00:13:08.350
I will not try to stop you-usa.

00:13:09.050 --> 00:13:11.010
And if that's what the charms decide,

00:13:11.630 --> 00:13:13.660
make sure to follow it through to the end-usa!

00:13:14.990 --> 00:13:16.600
Thank you, Usagi.

00:13:23.030 --> 00:13:24.300
But...!

00:13:24.300 --> 00:13:25.940
Dorothy, relax!

00:13:25.940 --> 00:13:27.990
Come on, let's go!

00:13:27.990 --> 00:13:30.330
Falulu's concert is starting!

00:13:30.330 --> 00:13:31.050
Huh?

00:13:31.050 --> 00:13:32.600
Falulu's concert?

00:13:34.330 --> 00:13:35.800
Make haste-rubens!

00:13:35.800 --> 00:13:38.540
Otherwise there won't be any good seats-daVinci!

00:13:43.900 --> 00:13:46.470
Can't see anything from here-easel!

00:13:46.470 --> 00:13:48.050
Falulu's great!

00:13:48.050 --> 00:13:49.830
Falulu, you're amazing!

00:13:49.830 --> 00:13:51.390
Amazing!

00:13:54.860 --> 00:13:57.310
Please scan the appropriate number of My Tickets for your coord.

00:13:58.020 --> 00:13:59.890
Coord Change Start!

00:14:01.950 --> 00:14:07.790
PriPara's popular winter coord strikes a splendid
balance with its warm fur and bold exposed shoulders.

00:14:07.790 --> 00:14:09.820
Jewlery Princess Coord!

00:14:16.200 --> 00:14:17.710
I'm so glad I'm a Falulu fan!

00:14:17.710 --> 00:14:19.670
We're here for you, Falulu!

00:14:19.670 --> 00:14:22.340
We love you!

00:14:22.340 --> 00:14:25.860
I'd like to announce something today.

00:14:25.860 --> 00:14:29.300
I'm joining the Princess Team!

00:14:29.300 --> 00:14:30.050
I love you, Falulu-san!

00:14:30.050 --> 00:14:31.540
Princess Team?

00:14:31.540 --> 00:14:33.990
Think she means Hibiki-sama's Prodigy Team?

00:14:33.990 --> 00:14:36.140
Then they're planning to win!

00:14:36.140 --> 00:14:37.050
How wonderful!

00:14:37.050 --> 00:14:38.880
Falulu really fits the image of a princess.

00:14:38.880 --> 00:14:40.490
Falulu-sama!

00:14:40.490 --> 00:14:44.440
Please listen to my "0-week-old".

00:16:14.530 --> 00:16:17.870
Making Drama Switch On!

00:16:31.450 --> 00:16:35.620
Hop!

00:16:40.800 --> 00:16:42.810
For all of you!

00:16:42.810 --> 00:16:45.310
Tick Tock Flower!

00:16:48.570 --> 00:16:50.700
Airy Change!

00:16:55.730 --> 00:16:57.910
Golden Airy!

00:17:24.980 --> 00:17:27.560
<i>I'm going to achieve that as well!</i>

00:17:27.910 --> 00:17:29.370
Beautiful.

00:17:29.370 --> 00:17:30.900
I want to do that as well!

00:17:48.770 --> 00:17:51.880
You want to join her team, don't you?

00:17:52.380 --> 00:17:55.420
No, I don't want to.

00:17:55.420 --> 00:17:56.600
Sophie,

00:17:56.600 --> 00:18:00.140
I'd love to see what you're like when you're free.

00:18:01.820 --> 00:18:03.930
I feel the same-pri.

00:18:05.390 --> 00:18:07.100
Lala...

00:18:07.100 --> 00:18:08.350
Mirei...

00:18:08.700 --> 00:18:11.850
You don't need to worry about us-pri.

00:18:11.850 --> 00:18:14.320
Stay honest to your feelings-pri.

00:18:14.740 --> 00:18:17.420
Your freedom is what's most important!

00:18:17.420 --> 00:18:20.280
We know that better than anyone!

00:18:23.240 --> 00:18:25.700
Well said, you two-kuma!

00:18:27.190 --> 00:18:28.290
Sophie!

00:18:28.960 --> 00:18:30.750
It's best that way-kuma.

00:18:33.710 --> 00:18:36.020
I can see perfectly from here-renoir.

00:18:36.020 --> 00:18:39.430
Too bad the concert is already over-michelangeloRodin!

00:18:39.430 --> 00:18:40.390
Vinci?

00:18:40.390 --> 00:18:41.680
Get her out of here, Andou!

00:18:41.680 --> 00:18:42.550
Yes, Hibiki-sama, right away!

00:18:42.550 --> 00:18:47.100
Vinci?

00:18:47.560 --> 00:18:49.450
What are you doing-rubens?

00:18:49.450 --> 00:18:51.720
Luna Warwick Ruso-DaVinci!

00:18:52.340 --> 00:18:53.960
Owwowow.

00:18:53.960 --> 00:18:55.290
DaVinci.

00:18:55.290 --> 00:18:56.860
That face,

00:18:57.300 --> 00:19:00.320
Ponkan has seen it before-daVinci.

00:19:03.650 --> 00:19:05.210
Get going, Shion.

00:19:06.370 --> 00:19:10.580
You realise that we probably can't keep our team the way it currently is, right?

00:19:10.580 --> 00:19:13.830
She wants you to do what you want, Shion.

00:19:15.050 --> 00:19:17.500
But it's most unfortunate.

00:19:17.500 --> 00:19:19.030
We'll be the ones to win.

00:19:19.030 --> 00:19:24.660
And besides, that hastily made Prodigy Team will fall apart just like okonomiyaki without batter.

00:19:24.660 --> 00:19:26.890
Don't end up regretting it later.

00:19:27.720 --> 00:19:29.620
It'll be fair and square!

00:19:29.620 --> 00:19:32.100
Let's perform as rivals without regrets!

00:19:38.990 --> 00:19:41.120
They're wonderful-nekon!

00:19:41.120 --> 00:19:42.880
Of course they are-usa!

00:19:42.880 --> 00:19:45.700
Those idols are my pride and joy-usa!

00:19:51.670 --> 00:19:52.830
Can I help you?

00:19:53.500 --> 00:19:54.510
Ah.

00:19:54.510 --> 00:19:57.440
You came to tell me you'd join my team,

00:19:57.440 --> 00:19:59.670
but ran out of energy part way here?

00:20:01.260 --> 00:20:02.670
Yeah.

00:20:04.640 --> 00:20:07.720
I welcome you, Houjou Sophie.

00:20:10.340 --> 00:20:11.320
Thanks.

00:20:14.100 --> 00:20:18.570
All right, don't you dare lose in the upcoming Team Effort vs Prodigy Team showdown!

00:20:18.570 --> 00:20:20.080
I'll put 101%...

00:20:20.080 --> 00:20:24.700
No, I'll put 102% effort into it to make sure we win-pri!

00:20:25.360 --> 00:20:27.560
You need to work on your balance first-kuma!

00:20:28.910 --> 00:20:31.620
Thing's aren't looking pretty-kuma.

00:20:36.890 --> 00:20:39.000
Just one to go...

00:22:15.570 --> 00:22:17.930
Christmas is full of fun things-nano!

00:22:17.930 --> 00:22:19.210
That's not true.

00:22:19.210 --> 00:22:22.580
Anko and Miruku are moving away from each other..

00:22:22.580 --> 00:22:23.810
Don't worry!

00:22:23.810 --> 00:22:26.070
There'll be a Christmas miracle!

00:22:26.070 --> 00:22:26.840
Next time:

00:22:26.840 --> 00:22:29.530
Happy Bye-bye Christmas-nano!
